#20000
The West Road Beyond the Gate~
   The road leaves the shadow of the west gate and runs out across a plain
of ash. Burned fields stretch to the horizon on both sides, the stubble
black and brittle. A wooden sign hangs from a post, its paint blistered:
MIDGAARD. TURN BACK.
