#20002
The Foot of the First Watchtower~
   A square stone tower stands beside the road, ringed by a ditch and a
palisade of stakes. Midgaard's grey banner hangs from its top. Soldiers on
the parapet watch every shadow on the plain, and the gate in the palisade
opens only for the living.
