#20004
The First Watchtower, Parapet~
   The wind tears at you on the tower top. From here you can see the other
two towers marching west along the road, the black ruins of Ashford to the
south, and beyond everything a dark line of forest on the western horizon.
Signal fires stand ready in iron baskets.
