#20009
The Hanging Oak~
   A huge oak, the only tree for leagues that did not burn, stands alone on
a rise. Its branches are heavy with hanged men and women, villagers who
refused to join the raiders. The rope burns on the bark are deep. The grass
beneath it has turned grey.
