#20017
Ashford Square~
   The village square is a ring of burned houses around a cracked fountain.
The raiders have made it their camp: tents of stolen cloth, a cookfire,
piles of loot. The villagers who were not hanged or hollowed are kept in a
pen of hurdles at the east end of the village.
