#20027
The Foot of the Last Watchtower~
   The last tower stands on a mound, the westernmost post of the Burned
Marches. Half its palisade is gone. The garrison here is the smallest and
the most scarred, and they have stopped counting the raids. Beyond the
mound, the road runs on into the dark of the Hollow Wood.
