The Ring of Stones~
   A ring of ancient standing stones crowns the hill, each stone smeared
with grey ash in the shape of a spiral. A bonfire of bones burns at the
centre. The Reaver of Ashford stands beside it, the first of the West's
champions to come within sight of Midgaard's walls.
